<km>

***  

A toolkit for interacting with MongoDB Atlas data in Gravwell. This kit includes queries, resources (lookups), templates, autoextractors, macros, dashboards, alerts, scheduled searches, and flows to help streamline MongoDB Atlas analysis across Atlas Access, Atlas Activity, Atlas Alert Configs, Atlas Alerts, Atlas Api Keys, Atlas Backups, Atlas Clusters, Atlas Custom Roles, Atlas Database Users, Atlas Events, Atlas Network Access, Atlas Org Activity, Atlas Org Users, Atlas Projects, and Atlas Service Accounts log sources.  

***  

