## 1. [Tags & Macros](#1-tags--macros)  

#### 1.1. [Tags](#1-1-tags)  

- Purpose: Tags are an essential Gravwell concept. Every entry has a single tag associated with it; these tags allow us to separate and categorize data at a basic level.  
- [Documentation](<https://docs.gravwell.io/ingesters/ingesters.html#tags>)  
- The MongoDB Atlas Kit for Gravwell makes use of the following tags:  
- Total: ***15***  
    - mongodb-atlas-access: Tag used for all MongoDB Atlas data; necessary for any queries within the Gravwell MongoDB Atlas Kit to run properly for dashboards, query library, and templates.  
        - Usage: `tag=mongodb-atlas-access`  
    - mongodb-atlas-activity: Tag used for all MongoDB Atlas data; necessary for any queries within the Gravwell MongoDB Atlas Kit to run properly for dashboards, query library, and templates.  
        - Usage: `tag=mongodb-atlas-activity`  
    - mongodb-atlas-alert-configs: Tag used for all MongoDB Atlas data; necessary for any queries within the Gravwell MongoDB Atlas Kit to run properly for dashboards, query library, and templates.  
        - Usage: `tag=mongodb-atlas-alert-configs`  
    - mongodb-atlas-alerts: Tag used for all MongoDB Atlas data; necessary for any queries within the Gravwell MongoDB Atlas Kit to run properly for dashboards, query library, and templates.  
        - Usage: `tag=mongodb-atlas-alerts`  
    - mongodb-atlas-api-keys: Tag used for all MongoDB Atlas data; necessary for any queries within the Gravwell MongoDB Atlas Kit to run properly for dashboards, query library, and templates.  
        - Usage: `tag=mongodb-atlas-api-keys`  
    - mongodb-atlas-backups: Tag used for all MongoDB Atlas data; necessary for any queries within the Gravwell MongoDB Atlas Kit to run properly for dashboards, query library, and templates.  
        - Usage: `tag=mongodb-atlas-backups`  
    - mongodb-atlas-clusters: Tag used for all MongoDB Atlas data; necessary for any queries within the Gravwell MongoDB Atlas Kit to run properly for dashboards, query library, and templates.  
        - Usage: `tag=mongodb-atlas-clusters`  
    - mongodb-atlas-custom-roles: Tag used for all MongoDB Atlas data; necessary for any queries within the Gravwell MongoDB Atlas Kit to run properly for dashboards, query library, and templates.  
        - Usage: `tag=mongodb-atlas-custom-roles`  
    - mongodb-atlas-database-users: Tag used for all MongoDB Atlas data; necessary for any queries within the Gravwell MongoDB Atlas Kit to run properly for dashboards, query library, and templates.  
        - Usage: `tag=mongodb-atlas-database-users`  
    - mongodb-atlas-events: Tag used for all MongoDB Atlas data; necessary for any queries within the Gravwell MongoDB Atlas Kit to run properly for dashboards, query library, and templates.  
        - Usage: `tag=mongodb-atlas-events`  
    - mongodb-atlas-network-access: Tag used for all MongoDB Atlas data; necessary for any queries within the Gravwell MongoDB Atlas Kit to run properly for dashboards, query library, and templates.  
        - Usage: `tag=mongodb-atlas-network-access`  
    - mongodb-atlas-org-activity: Tag used for all MongoDB Atlas data; necessary for any queries within the Gravwell MongoDB Atlas Kit to run properly for dashboards, query library, and templates.  
        - Usage: `tag=mongodb-atlas-org-activity`  
    - mongodb-atlas-org-users: Tag used for all MongoDB Atlas data; necessary for any queries within the Gravwell MongoDB Atlas Kit to run properly for dashboards, query library, and templates.  
        - Usage: `tag=mongodb-atlas-org-users`  
    - mongodb-atlas-projects: Tag used for all MongoDB Atlas data; necessary for any queries within the Gravwell MongoDB Atlas Kit to run properly for dashboards, query library, and templates.  
        - Usage: `tag=mongodb-atlas-projects`  
    - mongodb-atlas-service-accounts: Tag used for all MongoDB Atlas data; necessary for any queries within the Gravwell MongoDB Atlas Kit to run properly for dashboards, query library, and templates.  
        - Usage: `tag=mongodb-atlas-service-accounts`  

#### 1.2. [Autoextractors](#1-2-autoextractors)  

- Purpose: Autoextractors are simply definitions that can be applied to tags and describe how to correctly extract fields from the data in a given tag. The *ax* module then automatically invokes the appropriate functionality of other modules.  
- [Documentation](<https://docs.gravwell.io/configuration/autoextractors.html>)  
- The MongoDB Atlas Kit for Gravwell makes use of the following autoextractors:  
- Total: ***15***  
    - mongodb-atlas-access: Gravwell-generated JSON extraction for tag mongodb-atlas-access  
    - mongodb-atlas-activity: Gravwell-generated JSON extraction for tag mongodb-atlas-activity  
    - mongodb-atlas-alert-configs: Gravwell-generated JSON extraction for tag mongodb-atlas-alert-configs  
    - mongodb-atlas-alerts: Gravwell-generated JSON extraction for tag mongodb-atlas-alerts  
    - mongodb-atlas-api-keys: Gravwell-generated JSON extraction for tag mongodb-atlas-api-keys  
    - mongodb-atlas-backups: Gravwell-generated JSON extraction for tag mongodb-atlas-backups  
    - mongodb-atlas-clusters: Gravwell-generated JSON extraction for tag mongodb-atlas-clusters  
    - mongodb-atlas-custom-roles: Gravwell-generated JSON extraction for tag mongodb-atlas-custom-roles  
    - mongodb-atlas-database-users: Gravwell-generated JSON extraction for tag mongodb-atlas-database-users  
    - mongodb-atlas-events: Gravwell-generated JSON extraction for tag mongodb-atlas-events  
    - mongodb-atlas-network-access: Gravwell-generated JSON extraction for tag mongodb-atlas-network-access  
    - mongodb-atlas-org-activity: Gravwell-generated JSON extraction for tag mongodb-atlas-org-activity  
    - mongodb-atlas-org-users: Gravwell-generated JSON extraction for tag mongodb-atlas-org-users  
    - mongodb-atlas-projects: Gravwell-generated JSON extraction for tag mongodb-atlas-projects  
    - mongodb-atlas-service-accounts: Gravwell-generated JSON extraction for tag mongodb-atlas-service-accounts  

#### 1.3. [Macros](#1-3-macros)  

- Purpose: Search macros are a powerful feature that can help you use Gravwell more effectively. Macros can turn long, repetitive search queries into easily-remembered shortcuts.  
- [Documentation](<https://docs.gravwell.io/search/macros.html>)  
- The MongoDB Atlas Kit for Gravwell makes use of the following macros:  
- Total: ***24***  
    - GRAVWELL\_INSTANCE: Configuration Macro; Necessary for alerts within the MongoDB Kit to run properly; >:<change_to_your_specific_port>/  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS: Configuration Macro; Catch-all tag used for MongoDB Atlas Admin API data.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_ACCESS: Configuration Macro; Tag used for MongoDB Atlas database access history API data.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_ACTIVITY: Configuration Macro; Tag used for MongoDB Atlas project activity event API data.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_ALERT\_CONFIGS: Configuration Macro; Tag used for MongoDB Atlas alert configuration API data.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_ALERT\_META: Alert metadata macro for MongoDB Atlas alerts and high-signal Admin API activity.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_ALERT\_RECIPIENT: This is the address to which MongoDB Alert Flows will be sent to.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_ALERT\_RISK\_LOOKUP: Lookup macro for MongoDB Atlas alert risk grouping and reason enrichment.  
        - Usage: 
        ```
        dump -r mongodb-atlas-alert-risk-catalog eventTypeName eventTypeName (risk reason)
        ```
        ```
        tag=MONGODB_ATLAS ax
        $MONGODB_ATLAS_ALERT_RISK_LOOKUP
        ```
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_ALERT\_SENDER: This is the address to which MongoDB Alert Flows will be sent from.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_ALERT\_STATUS\_LOOKUP: Lookup macro for MongoDB Atlas alert status descriptions.  
        - Usage: 
        ```
        dump -r mongodb-atlas-alert-statuses status status (description as statusDescription)
        ```
        ```
        tag=MONGODB_ATLAS ax
        $MONGODB_ATLAS_ALERT_STATUS_LOOKUP
        ```
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_ALERTS: Configuration Macro; Tag used for MongoDB Atlas alert API data.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_API\_KEYS: Configuration Macro; Tag used for MongoDB Atlas organization API key API data.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_BACKUPS: Configuration Macro; Tag used for MongoDB Atlas cloud backup snapshot API data.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_CLUSTERS: Configuration Macro; Tag used for MongoDB Atlas cluster API data.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_CUSTOM\_ROLES: Configuration Macro; Tag used for MongoDB Atlas custom database role API data.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_DATABASE\_USERS: Configuration Macro; Tag used for MongoDB Atlas database user API data.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_ENRICH\_COMMON: Common MongoDB Atlas Admin API enrichment macro for alerts, dashboards, and investigations.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_EVENTS: Configuration Macro; Tag used for MongoDB Atlas project and organization events, including service account event types.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_NETWORK\_ACCESS: Configuration Macro; Tag used for MongoDB Atlas project IP access list API data.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_ORG\_ACTIVITY: Configuration Macro; Tag used for MongoDB Atlas organization activity event API data.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_ORG\_USERS: Configuration Macro; Tag used for MongoDB Atlas organization user API data.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_PROJECTS: Configuration Macro; Tag used for MongoDB Atlas project API data.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_RISK\_SCORE: Risk scoring macro for MongoDB Atlas alerts, project activity, identity changes, network exposure, backup failures, and degraded infrastructure.  
    - MONGODB\_ATLAS\_SERVICE\_ACCOUNTS: Configuration Macro; Tag used for MongoDB Atlas service account API data.  

