## 12. [Notes](#12-notes)  

- Default log source mapping for MongoDB Atlas Kit:  
    - mongodb-atlas-access = Atlas Access  
    - mongodb-atlas-activity = Atlas Activity  
    - mongodb-atlas-alert-configs = Atlas Alert Configs  
    - mongodb-atlas-alerts = Atlas Alerts  
    - mongodb-atlas-api-keys = Atlas Api Keys  
    - mongodb-atlas-backups = Atlas Backups  
    - mongodb-atlas-clusters = Atlas Clusters  
    - mongodb-atlas-custom-roles = Atlas Custom Roles  
    - mongodb-atlas-database-users = Atlas Database Users  
    - mongodb-atlas-events = Atlas Events  
    - mongodb-atlas-network-access = Atlas Network Access  
    - mongodb-atlas-org-activity = Atlas Org Activity  
    - mongodb-atlas-org-users = Atlas Org Users  
    - mongodb-atlas-projects = Atlas Projects  
    - mongodb-atlas-service-accounts = Atlas Service Accounts  

